ICMP Packet Analysis Report
Objective

The objective of this analysis is to examine an ICMP (Internet Control Message Protocol) packet capture using Wireshark to understand packet communication, verify connectivity, inspect protocol fields, and identify any anomalies or indicators of network issues. This report documents the observed ICMP traffic from a SOC Analyst perspective.

